{
  "name": "Servant Summon: Undine II",
  "type": "skill",
  "system": {
    "description": "\n        <p>Can be acquired at CR16 or higher. You gain the [Fairy] and [Cold] tags. +[SR×7] to the damage rolls of your attacks with the [Cold] tag. (Guaranteed Effect) Deal [INT] direct damage to a secondary target within \"Target: Single / Range: 4 Sq.\" of you.</p>\n        <hr>\n        <p>A skill that allows the user to summon Undine, a water fairy with a beautiful maiden's appearance, and bind a high-level contract to command it. The enhanced water flow and cold air drain all heat from enemies.</p>\n        ",
